**The real dependency chain, stated without softening.**
- T1 and T2 now depend on R0 and R1 of the register design, which are not authorized and not started. Before this revision they depended only on B1 to B3, which are merged. Authorizing any foreign kernel now means authorizing R0 and R1 first.
